PASS LISTCALL: refused at the list: `[(=d) = B(A)]` in place True, in a binding True, `[(=l) = atomic(B | A)]` True; the body's own `d` listed (`/${rx}-(?<d>\d)/`) differing 0; A6, a call exports what its body exports: `B(A) & (B.d: <5)`, B(rx) := `/${[p = rx]}xx/` (p's `d` by name) differing 0
