PASS OUTSIDE: `pub.h`, pub := `[a = A] SEQ A`, against "the FIRST digit under 5" (the exported `a`'s, not the last mention): differing 0; `B.a`, B := `A & /(?<a>\d)/`, legal from outside (the protected side no source) differing 0; inside B the plain `a` refused as ambiguous True
