PASS OWNUSE: `[a = A] SEQ "!"`: `A.h` refused (no unlabelled use) True; `[a = A] SEQ A`: `A.h` reads the unlabelled use (the second digit) differing 0, `a.h` the labelled one differing 0; `[A = A] SEQ A`: `A.h` is the label's (the first digit) differing 0, the hide-label warning True
