PASS ARGOWN: `occurrences(/(?<n>\d+)/ & (n: <100))`: legal under (local) True and (error) True, the same WHOLE answers over ['1234', '123', '12', '1', '12345'] (`1234` HOLDS under (error) True); a read OUTSIDE the argument (`hits(/a(?<g>x)?/) & (g: "x")`) still refused under (error) True
