PASS LISTCOLL: `d.year`, d := `[(=year) = i1] SEQ [(=year) = i2]`, against "i2's year (the last mention) is 20": differing 0 of 4; inside a binding that lists the part, its own prefix `isodate.year` refused True, a listed part label's path `q.a.h` refused True (the list takes the listed labels only: path `isodate.year`: `isodate` is neither written nor a binding used in this definition)
