== TOPLEVEL (D8, D17): at the top nothing is outside; the plain idiom with one use (ruled by default-export)
PASS TOPLEVEL: `isodate & (isodate.year: < 2100)` (isodate used alone at the top) against "year under 2100": differing 0 of 4
